<abbreviation>OGC</abbreviation><logo type="html-blue"><image src="/usr/local/bundle/gems/metanorma-ogc-2.9.11/lib/isodoc/ogc/html/logo.2018.png" mimetype="image/png"/></logo>
<logo type="html-white"><image src="/usr/local/bundle/gems/metanorma-ogc-2.9.11/lib/isodoc/ogc/html/logo.2018-white.png" mimetype="image/png"/></logo>
