<p id="_dd2c0819-0d55-7dc0-9aff-f1a4ab960917" semx-id="_dd2c0819-0d55-7dc0-9aff-f1a4ab960917">A detailed discussion of the structuring of the UML model can be found in the <link target="http://docs.opengeospatial.org/DRAFTS/20-066.html#ug-model-structure-section" id="_4af65526-8b17-9370-1b06-7c3208eb1f7e">OGC CityGML 3.0 Users Guide</link><fmt-link target="http://docs.opengeospatial.org/DRAFTS/20-066.html#ug-model-structure-section">OGC CityGML 3.0 Users Guide</fmt-link>.</p>
