</td>
</tr><tr id="_64504199-0fb7-9e81-7159-b36eeed995fc" semx-id="_64504199-0fb7-9e81-7159-b36eeed995fc"><td id="_6d0e0270-6e13-d26d-7a84-77804f2381e7" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_6d0e0270-6e13-d26d-7a84-77804f2381e7"><p id="_fcdb0401-8c0b-d72f-70e8-6af09aaf739b" semx-id="_fcdb0401-8c0b-d72f-70e8-6af09aaf739b">AbstractUnoccupiedSpace</p>
</td>
<td id="_d28e39ac-414d-7d5c-6eea-ade8f41500eb" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_d28e39ac-414d-7d5c-6eea-ade8f41500eb"><ul id="_716b0c85-2e7a-cef1-c23d-a00750a89771" semx-id="_716b0c85-2e7a-cef1-c23d-a00750a89771"><li id="_b77a1083-05cf-21f6-88b7-549e71d1c167"><fmt-name id="_b3da3f68-0197-f277-29db-6290dac103cd">•</fmt-name><p id="_33a5e827-44ae-a57e-90f4-5b2a0f66b2eb" semx-id="_33a5e827-44ae-a57e-90f4-5b2a0f66b2eb">Core::AbstractSpaceBoundary and the subclasses:</p>
<ul id="_d6f34d50-bbbb-550e-ee63-6287dfc6d765" semx-id="_d6f34d50-bbbb-550e-ee63-6287dfc6d765"><li id="_317e2b48-770c-e626-c553-fc8bab16bee6"><fmt-name id="_735fa513-b476-ed4b-cff0-950c9051584a">•</fmt-name><p id="_96d265c8-d8ce-ffee-1eb1-5ce5e1799513" semx-id="_96d265c8-d8ce-ffee-1eb1-5ce5e1799513">Core::AbstractThematicSurface,</p>
</li>
