</tr><tr id="_0a32f354-2534-e212-438b-b6166d4ab596" semx-id="_0a32f354-2534-e212-438b-b6166d4ab596"><td id="_9f627178-dae1-e02c-f51c-80e7a180efbe" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_9f627178-dae1-e02c-f51c-80e7a180efbe"><p id="_70ecd4b6-df70-0556-a335-cadb133e4989" semx-id="_70ecd4b6-df70-0556-a335-cadb133e4989"><xref target="GM_Surface-section" id="_22fc375b-23b9-36fe-b06c-d670d82c9874">GM_Surface</xref><fmt-xref target="GM_Surface-section">GM_Surface</fmt-xref></p>
</td>
<td id="_09e7ee8d-e361-dcd4-043c-f646c8a63f17" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_09e7ee8d-e361-dcd4-043c-f646c8a63f17"><p id="_279b3590-68fe-791e-9e16-3ae885395e38" semx-id="_279b3590-68fe-791e-9e16-3ae885395e38">The basis for 2-dimensional geometry.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_999e0954-9e4e-507a-3495-6c0f662dedc9" semx-id="_999e0954-9e4e-507a-3495-6c0f662dedc9"><td id="_c063c705-cbc9-b241-1605-d4c78a991f91" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_c063c705-cbc9-b241-1605-d4c78a991f91"><p id="_0c96f894-cd54-4970-7e0a-4a28a60c0dfa" semx-id="_0c96f894-cd54-4970-7e0a-4a28a60c0dfa"><xref target="GM_Tin-section" id="_7f8a6918-ec9c-c1d9-adad-823fa79c6f0d">GM_Tin</xref><fmt-xref target="GM_Tin-section">GM_Tin</fmt-xref></p>
</td>
<td id="_5507c356-fc9d-0a1e-ea93-33662725557f" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_5507c356-fc9d-0a1e-ea93-33662725557f"><p id="_ead056ae-cc93-bd2c-b5c5-318aa2d481fa" semx-id="_ead056ae-cc93-bd2c-b5c5-318aa2d481fa">A GM_TriangulatedSurface which uses the Delaunay or similar algorithm.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_43d22f38-fef0-08f8-a625-7b964a10b660" semx-id="_43d22f38-fef0-08f8-a625-7b964a10b660"><td id="_a76afe81-f475-f297-211b-31d8cd1a68d5" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_a76afe81-f475-f297-211b-31d8cd1a68d5"><p id="_3172ecc4-c979-5caa-dc41-43d93ce20f6e" semx-id="_3172ecc4-c979-5caa-dc41-43d93ce20f6e"><xref target="GM_TriangulatedSurface-section" id="_1b7cc179-c2d0-9ae7-c9aa-1f633221d99d">GM_TriangulatedSurface</xref><fmt-xref target="GM_TriangulatedSurface-section">GM_TriangulatedSurface</fmt-xref></p>
</td>
<td id="_5296fd14-56a1-bc85-9b92-972c32e61304" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_5296fd14-56a1-bc85-9b92-972c32e61304"><p id="_71a5c288-d3a9-59bc-4091-a3d4e0070b01" semx-id="_71a5c288-d3a9-59bc-4091-a3d4e0070b01">A GM_PolyhedralSurface that is composed only of triangles</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_c42beb77-c5d9-248a-76bc-7a92afdb66e2" semx-id="_c42beb77-c5d9-248a-76bc-7a92afdb66e2"><td id="_a39e26b5-ec8d-8bfe-d650-22a5b77de0fd" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_a39e26b5-ec8d-8bfe-d650-22a5b77de0fd"><p id="_c6229a67-c099-2084-996f-55e4b11aaf0b" semx-id="_c6229a67-c099-2084-996f-55e4b11aaf0b"><xref target="SC_CRS-section" id="_8ba10b65-77a1-390a-8a3d-39b637fc8bb8">SC_CRS</xref><fmt-xref target="SC_CRS-section">SC_CRS</fmt-xref></p>
</td>
<td id="_498e7eec-7a69-368e-277c-6166c3561431" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_498e7eec-7a69-368e-277c-6166c3561431"><p id="_aa4ef777-14fe-8b76-98a2-c252da6a741c" semx-id="_aa4ef777-14fe-8b76-98a2-c252da6a741c">Coordinate reference system which is usually single but may be compound.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_d4962af3-f289-e854-fad3-69b336a3ba55" semx-id="_d4962af3-f289-e854-fad3-69b336a3ba55"><td id="_fd29c5b3-c7a6-e9fe-219b-ddbadf6fcacf" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_fd29c5b3-c7a6-e9fe-219b-ddbadf6fcacf"><p id="_06280703-a891-802b-199a-10913816fdc0" semx-id="_06280703-a891-802b-199a-10913816fdc0"><xref target="TM_Position-section" id="_f7973227-6dde-16b5-dece-84984d102a52">TM_Position</xref><fmt-xref target="TM_Position-section">TM_Position</fmt-xref></p>
</td>
