</td>
</tr><tr id="_cbad967d-bfcd-e506-aaf1-24662c573715" semx-id="_cbad967d-bfcd-e506-aaf1-24662c573715"><td id="_85d99270-8d5e-849d-39fb-7ce2cd5a63f6" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_85d99270-8d5e-849d-39fb-7ce2cd5a63f6"><p id="_3865062e-ae03-7663-28b4-15d6ac8fcab9" semx-id="_3865062e-ae03-7663-28b4-15d6ac8fcab9"><xref target="section-EAID_3A735B27_A45C_431e_9A2C_7EE61F753E34" id="_9a592adb-3fa9-780c-a98b-867b7f0e09f9">CityModel</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_3A735B27_A45C_431e_9A2C_7EE61F753E34">CityModel</fmt-xref> «FeatureType»</p>
