<td id="_750a01e4-482c-9afd-fa28-8cb040bf3a92" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_750a01e4-482c-9afd-fa28-8cb040bf3a92"><p id="_2ec34d06-340f-83f9-b636-29def5d1d81a" semx-id="_2ec34d06-340f-83f9-b636-29def5d1d81a">Address represents an address of a city object.</p>
