<td id="_f794e000-c7b7-8b76-75c6-3011012d5df8" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_f794e000-c7b7-8b76-75c6-3011012d5df8"><p id="_cbd4f325-9c87-5a1f-4a95-00695b051f45" semx-id="_cbd4f325-9c87-5a1f-4a95-00695b051f45">XALAddress represents address details according to the OASIS xAL standard.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

<table id="_542f4243-7e5c-d70d-4419-10f4d40776e1" semx-id="_542f4243-7e5c-d70d-4419-10f4d40776e1" autonum="9"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="75%"/></colgroup>
<name id="_f3d0de37-bfb7-259c-1998-6868d5337880" semx-id="_ea3ed161-86a6-5991-b4a7-2195254f03e0">Primitive data types defined in Core (ApplicationSchema)</name><fmt-name id="_e74fc851-18e8-c627-5cde-5f71cf7fe117"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 9</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"> — </span><semx element="name" source="_f3d0de37-bfb7-259c-1998-6868d5337880">Primitive data types defined in Core (ApplicationSchema)</semx></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 9</fmt-xref-label>
<thead><tr id="_798de1bd-d774-5dc7-5fd4-d813fb61ca28" semx-id="_798de1bd-d774-5dc7-5fd4-d813fb61ca28"><th id="_9e6883c8-e2ed-1af3-a738-7d3d806b3171" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_9e6883c8-e2ed-1af3-a738-7d3d806b3171">Name</th>
<th id="_789a7537-da03-2259-51df-900cceea3438" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_789a7537-da03-2259-51df-900cceea3438">Description</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody><tr id="_1855312e-8d1c-5b33-85d5-0399292f872d" semx-id="_1855312e-8d1c-5b33-85d5-0399292f872d"><td id="_0fd37920-32de-528e-1cb7-fe74b71208a0" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_0fd37920-32de-528e-1cb7-fe74b71208a0"><p id="_1b7a60a3-ecc8-613c-e9cd-185544d994a8" semx-id="_1b7a60a3-ecc8-613c-e9cd-185544d994a8"><xref target="section-EAID_6197BD4C_F550_488b_B296_8AB4089D137E" id="_3ed00ca9-6441-7ef3-a09f-a9cb72bbef5e">Code</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_6197BD4C_F550_488b_B296_8AB4089D137E">Code</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_aa198893-d5bf-6238-96ae-9a86fdfbb258" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_aa198893-d5bf-6238-96ae-9a86fdfbb258"><p id="_22666707-2e6e-d91e-0f38-d64fd91fd198" semx-id="_22666707-2e6e-d91e-0f38-d64fd91fd198">Code is a basic type for a String-based term, keyword, or name that can additionally have a code space.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_f708c76f-d2c1-0b81-bb08-efb74294d9f3" semx-id="_f708c76f-d2c1-0b81-bb08-efb74294d9f3"><td id="_b489a1bd-742b-6f86-4a47-6b057a0637ba" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_b489a1bd-742b-6f86-4a47-6b057a0637ba"><p id="_31c9a057-3e7b-e7f8-f29a-5c2c9de2f176" semx-id="_31c9a057-3e7b-e7f8-f29a-5c2c9de2f176"><xref target="section-EAID_092CCC50_BAA5_4a68_878C_37E253FFDCD3" id="_305bbe3f-1898-2de5-8549-167a5c5acc65">DoubleBetween0and1</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_092CCC50_BAA5_4a68_878C_37E253FFDCD3">DoubleBetween0and1</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_abddcf2c-4af5-a12f-34e8-1d089e045147" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_abddcf2c-4af5-a12f-34e8-1d089e045147"><p id="_4f267ecc-b7b0-0002-6933-fef8ac33d4fd" semx-id="_4f267ecc-b7b0-0002-6933-fef8ac33d4fd">DoubleBetween0and1 is a basic type for values, which are greater or equal than 0 and less or equal than 1. The type is used for color encoding, for example.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_d9224c3f-655f-9214-7c95-0bcfd7c0b953" semx-id="_d9224c3f-655f-9214-7c95-0bcfd7c0b953"><td id="_a9356a43-8bcc-9f4f-af32-a56e4012c988" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_a9356a43-8bcc-9f4f-af32-a56e4012c988"><p id="_ca7358c8-d5ac-8bab-f593-ede18becfbf3" semx-id="_ca7358c8-d5ac-8bab-f593-ede18becfbf3"><xref target="section-EAID_41C5C705_4B6B_4978_A61B_6548E3744AD5" id="_4ca15f1b-f599-49c2-3544-00b6e9cff25b">DoubleBetween0and1List</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_41C5C705_4B6B_4978_A61B_6548E3744AD5">DoubleBetween0and1List</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_b23f8247-9421-1dd5-550e-7d4f21da3827" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_b23f8247-9421-1dd5-550e-7d4f21da3827"><p id="_6b0a0bc0-dd4d-0690-ce83-740899f249a4" semx-id="_6b0a0bc0-dd4d-0690-ce83-740899f249a4">DoubleBetween0and1List is a basic type that represents a list of double values greater or equal than 0 and less or equal than 1. The type is used for color encoding, for example.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_f194dbeb-1c1a-91a1-a9bc-e71b023f7bb4" semx-id="_f194dbeb-1c1a-91a1-a9bc-e71b023f7bb4"><td id="_afce8ac1-00be-c3b7-6bed-2d0f111665d9" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_afce8ac1-00be-c3b7-6bed-2d0f111665d9"><p id="_ca277985-f1ca-b24b-cbe8-6d7ea9fea066" semx-id="_ca277985-f1ca-b24b-cbe8-6d7ea9fea066"><xref target="section-EAID_52B350D6_3330_4c12_BDB9_575810B2A765" id="_8c1b6a73-9cf0-bad8-a7d2-395cc4c4b351">DoubleList</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_52B350D6_3330_4c12_BDB9_575810B2A765">DoubleList</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_2a69039a-ea2a-ab0d-9c7c-d25f2627c89e" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_2a69039a-ea2a-ab0d-9c7c-d25f2627c89e"><p id="_b54ec255-6976-cfee-50a9-bc99484659fb" semx-id="_b54ec255-6976-cfee-50a9-bc99484659fb">DoubleList is an ordered sequence of double values.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_8a5c93a0-9105-ad83-b08f-a94e58f24b2c" semx-id="_8a5c93a0-9105-ad83-b08f-a94e58f24b2c"><td id="_b020106b-a26a-baaf-f12d-eb66e650b6d4" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_b020106b-a26a-baaf-f12d-eb66e650b6d4"><p id="_ebc117d1-6bdb-6a3f-ac39-4b73cb184303" semx-id="_ebc117d1-6bdb-6a3f-ac39-4b73cb184303"><xref target="section-EAID_9408E82F_1A8F_4c06_92E8_F53FBE5B0063" id="_c00c12b8-036f-aff0-eaff-21b074451afb">DoubleOrNilReasonList</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_9408E82F_1A8F_4c06_92E8_F53FBE5B0063">DoubleOrNilReasonList</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_580b3824-9b0f-5357-f841-880756a34fb6" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_580b3824-9b0f-5357-f841-880756a34fb6"><p id="_c36f4b11-43c5-c441-fb8a-569268d1bf24" semx-id="_c36f4b11-43c5-c441-fb8a-569268d1bf24">DoubleOrNilReasonList is a basic type that represents a list of double values and/or nil reasons.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_ae645acc-ce25-50bd-cfdd-bb31ca78c0a6" semx-id="_ae645acc-ce25-50bd-cfdd-bb31ca78c0a6"><td id="_06535796-3514-a12a-eeff-3c20ad4973e6" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_06535796-3514-a12a-eeff-3c20ad4973e6"><p id="_842f6f99-95cc-6de0-10b5-d81dcd48a7cf" semx-id="_842f6f99-95cc-6de0-10b5-d81dcd48a7cf"><xref target="section-EAID_1A4270D5_EB40_4031_AEDB_4371868CA2EF" id="_95076af8-66d7-bc0f-4bd6-252ea51d7947">ID</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_1A4270D5_EB40_4031_AEDB_4371868CA2EF">ID</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_811d81f7-c5f5-269a-1971-42c4432b68db" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_811d81f7-c5f5-269a-1971-42c4432b68db"><p id="_f4b01f90-33c5-6358-faf1-ca30545d1782" semx-id="_f4b01f90-33c5-6358-faf1-ca30545d1782">ID is a basic type that represents a unique identifier.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_43ed4174-bf36-3546-36be-373015261488" semx-id="_43ed4174-bf36-3546-36be-373015261488"><td id="_60e8d42d-841d-c996-acac-3fe4c2c9595f" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_60e8d42d-841d-c996-acac-3fe4c2c9595f"><p id="_c1b1f475-b526-0318-81ed-7aba3171407a" semx-id="_c1b1f475-b526-0318-81ed-7aba3171407a"><xref target="section-EAID_C4D25E26_5DFC_461f_902F_0A5385B7BEC4" id="_b7bfe2be-2515-0b28-06e5-c241d8df8719">IntegerBetween0and3</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_C4D25E26_5DFC_461f_902F_0A5385B7BEC4">IntegerBetween0and3</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_d46ac6b1-8975-7c52-ac32-53bce85b071c" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_d46ac6b1-8975-7c52-ac32-53bce85b071c"><p id="_c0672dba-367e-8c52-1bf6-6afef04d024a" semx-id="_c0672dba-367e-8c52-1bf6-6afef04d024a">IntegerBetween0and3 is a basic type for integer values, which are greater or equal than 0 and less or equal than 3. The type is used for encoding the LOD number.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_b6b50e23-1dc5-dd81-9a5a-cb1f537f533d" semx-id="_b6b50e23-1dc5-dd81-9a5a-cb1f537f533d"><td id="_37d5d0cf-640f-1736-dc53-f95401b18e9d" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_37d5d0cf-640f-1736-dc53-f95401b18e9d"><p id="_c9baa0fa-a123-a124-7956-76abaffc7551" semx-id="_c9baa0fa-a123-a124-7956-76abaffc7551"><xref target="section-EAID_2EA991C5_0D33_4bd2_AC90_CA5338E57948" id="_ef90785f-87f3-0de8-7a6d-4a9d70e6cb71">MeasureOrNilReasonList</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_2EA991C5_0D33_4bd2_AC90_CA5338E57948">MeasureOrNilReasonList</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_b5dec476-d20f-8f0a-1c48-b3efe7ed2c2d" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_b5dec476-d20f-8f0a-1c48-b3efe7ed2c2d"><p id="_4ac4767e-9164-a0b2-ccef-5aaad723218d" semx-id="_4ac4767e-9164-a0b2-ccef-5aaad723218d">MeasureOrNilReasonList is a basic type that represents a list of double values and/or nil reasons together with a unit of measurement.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_1ab666e6-2a90-d86c-5bcf-f62fdeb675a4" semx-id="_1ab666e6-2a90-d86c-5bcf-f62fdeb675a4"><td id="_3f986cb9-3853-2f7c-3bb0-b2e2187a3da3" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_3f986cb9-3853-2f7c-3bb0-b2e2187a3da3"><p id="_096c0c8f-8d05-76ac-5641-40f1acc6b96e" semx-id="_096c0c8f-8d05-76ac-5641-40f1acc6b96e"><xref target="section-EAID_085F2447_D537_4da6_9CE9_D3BBEC6C1AEC" id="_3800b61c-d10a-c8ea-e73a-33ec90eda07a">TransformationMatrix2x2</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_085F2447_D537_4da6_9CE9_D3BBEC6C1AEC">TransformationMatrix2x2</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_98b029ba-07c5-5306-fe3d-07922701de08" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_98b029ba-07c5-5306-fe3d-07922701de08"><p id="_083062c5-b3a4-4640-4e53-f79f8c0e77d5" semx-id="_083062c5-b3a4-4640-4e53-f79f8c0e77d5">TransformationMatrix2x2 is a 2 by 2 matrix represented as a list of four double values in row major order.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_8826f28e-0199-3203-1d31-46a83f28fada" semx-id="_8826f28e-0199-3203-1d31-46a83f28fada"><td id="_b329e339-9c2b-fbe2-d29a-64918425613e" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_b329e339-9c2b-fbe2-d29a-64918425613e"><p id="_2def3127-bae1-d7b2-ca38-d7eb60d411d2" semx-id="_2def3127-bae1-d7b2-ca38-d7eb60d411d2"><xref target="section-EAID_F1BDB5FA_A6E3_4d12_9995_B1BB2FEBB7AD" id="_ca547e9d-33d1-cf3d-8393-b2b79693dafa">TransformationMatrix3x4</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_F1BDB5FA_A6E3_4d12_9995_B1BB2FEBB7AD">TransformationMatrix3x4</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_1b2f5ff4-8987-1a42-70db-24ed66d2bfe0" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_1b2f5ff4-8987-1a42-70db-24ed66d2bfe0"><p id="_bc897e75-d700-18c4-dd09-7003fccccb78" semx-id="_bc897e75-d700-18c4-dd09-7003fccccb78">TransformationMatrix3x4 is a 3 by 4 matrix represented as a list of twelve double values in row major order.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_5bb78c68-5e0f-c8fc-2c22-f0ea3cf5c9b6" semx-id="_5bb78c68-5e0f-c8fc-2c22-f0ea3cf5c9b6"><td id="_06669130-35a1-1397-3171-9ccd0261cc7a" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_06669130-35a1-1397-3171-9ccd0261cc7a"><p id="_eb1eef94-29ef-e5f1-943b-4bbb4725eb95" semx-id="_eb1eef94-29ef-e5f1-943b-4bbb4725eb95"><xref target="section-EAID_80ECB33C_03A6_479c_AD73_42429A9A7C1A" id="_84c9dcff-e563-025c-b45b-300c7945cd52">TransformationMatrix4x4</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_80ECB33C_03A6_479c_AD73_42429A9A7C1A">TransformationMatrix4x4</fmt-xref> «BasicType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_52dfc184-95f6-3c2b-2435-773a80e3c4c4" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_52dfc184-95f6-3c2b-2435-773a80e3c4c4"><p id="_5a26fc85-8df8-199f-7448-05230cb33a9e" semx-id="_5a26fc85-8df8-199f-7448-05230cb33a9e">TransformationMatrix4x4 is a 4 by 4 matrix represented as a list of sixteen double values in row major order.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

<table id="_bee249f2-5561-b1ca-3cb0-7685e01629f8" semx-id="_bee249f2-5561-b1ca-3cb0-7685e01629f8" autonum="10"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="75%"/></colgroup>
