</td>
<td id="_8dc5577c-5765-7d30-9f7f-1dfc517ac5ef" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_8dc5577c-5765-7d30-9f7f-1dfc517ac5ef"><p id="_33f5f189-01bf-2be9-35b5-4c5aabed6841" semx-id="_33f5f189-01bf-2be9-35b5-4c5aabed6841">CityFurniture is an object or piece of equipment installed in the outdoor environment for various purposes. Examples include street signs, traffic signals, street lamps, benches, fountains.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

<table id="_b4b3b067-d7f5-05e4-13c6-b622b1a163ec" semx-id="_b4b3b067-d7f5-05e4-13c6-b622b1a163ec" autonum="19"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="75%"/></colgroup>
