<p id="_c0034080-1eed-0306-1d5e-2924a79a2035" semx-id="_c0034080-1eed-0306-1d5e-2924a79a2035"><xref target="cityobjectgroup-boundaries-table" id="_6d8cf7cc-5ef5-1a7a-8591-e70a2716f8e4"/><fmt-xref target="cityobjectgroup-boundaries-table"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 21</fmt-xref> lists the surfaces that are allowed as thematic surface boundaries of the space classes defined in the CityObjectGroup module:</p>

