</td>
<td id="_e16edd02-e369-028f-a80e-907572e4cf91" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_e16edd02-e369-028f-a80e-907572e4cf91"><p id="_bf6559c8-d647-d30a-eec9-4996b70fa876" semx-id="_bf6559c8-d647-d30a-eec9-4996b70fa876">ADEOfCityObjectGroup acts as a hook to define properties within an ADE that are to be added to a CityObjectGroup.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

