<td id="_8867ff77-32cf-f094-8f98-276ca2df714a" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_8867ff77-32cf-f094-8f98-276ca2df714a"><p id="_de2e2b0e-f060-255a-e876-7ec389c5ea81" semx-id="_de2e2b0e-f060-255a-e876-7ec389c5ea81">GenericThematicSurfaceFunctionValue is a code list that enumerates the different purposes of a GenericThematicSurface.</p>
