<td id="_b4bac0fc-cefa-d2c4-eec3-ed6e284c38e6" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_b4bac0fc-cefa-d2c4-eec3-ed6e284c38e6"><p id="_2b6555e1-504b-3cd6-aa20-627c13db0e2a" semx-id="_2b6555e1-504b-3cd6-aa20-627c13db0e2a">GenericUnoccupiedSpaceClassValue is a code list used to further classify a GenericUnoccupiedSpace.</p>
