<td id="_4bd87192-6069-d20e-d384-59cc5ff0d50f" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_4bd87192-6069-d20e-d384-59cc5ff0d50f"><p id="_bf827047-65c3-18cd-83f0-44d4a5fa9c5a" semx-id="_bf827047-65c3-18cd-83f0-44d4a5fa9c5a">GenericUnoccupiedSpaceFunctionValue is a code list that enumerates the different purposes of a GenericUnoccupiedSpace.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_37de5a44-2b64-30fd-8d04-7604dd01e24f" semx-id="_37de5a44-2b64-30fd-8d04-7604dd01e24f"><td id="_2de57ab4-d1c0-1ab9-0337-38024ae99ded" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_2de57ab4-d1c0-1ab9-0337-38024ae99ded"><p id="_4c24efe2-ff0e-e247-115c-82ecc7c3ad68" semx-id="_4c24efe2-ff0e-e247-115c-82ecc7c3ad68"><xref target="section-EAID_E7EB0587_FAE8_422f_A381_309ECFE5B4E9" id="_b9f60649-2290-45c2-78eb-c4e83c81ec8b">GenericUnoccupiedSpaceUsageValue</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_E7EB0587_FAE8_422f_A381_309ECFE5B4E9">GenericUnoccupiedSpaceUsageValue</fmt-xref> «CodeList»</p>
