<td id="_84756926-9950-c8ed-d987-5df05b0798e6" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_84756926-9950-c8ed-d987-5df05b0798e6"><p id="_4351291d-5f20-57d0-f1aa-4e90e36029d7" semx-id="_4351291d-5f20-57d0-f1aa-4e90e36029d7">ADEOfLandUse acts as a hook to define properties within an ADE that are to be added to a LandUse.</p>
