<td id="_55c8b97d-a55a-40fb-0eaa-1b735e9259d9" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_55c8b97d-a55a-40fb-0eaa-1b735e9259d9"><p id="_d39b5e8d-ec4f-6970-1d5e-edbfcad842cd" semx-id="_d39b5e8d-ec4f-6970-1d5e-edbfcad842cd">LandUseClassValue is a code list used to further classify a LandUse.</p>
