<th id="_f0d9fd57-20c2-254f-fa24-81c49aef3762" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_f0d9fd57-20c2-254f-fa24-81c49aef3762">Description</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody><tr id="_a4ab86b4-953c-a797-1920-3949e4876c0b" semx-id="_a4ab86b4-953c-a797-1920-3949e4876c0b"><td id="_3cbe0d9a-dab0-ef0e-b812-0a37dded2a7c" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_3cbe0d9a-dab0-ef0e-b812-0a37dded2a7c"><p id="_237e18c9-cec7-76b4-5631-c868e90c390a" semx-id="_237e18c9-cec7-76b4-5631-c868e90c390a"><xref target="section-EAID_AC09C7DF_9D65_427c_8B92_5E168ACFE497" id="_a0e5cdc6-b67f-ae3a-8505-30fe9d70de80">PointCloud</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_AC09C7DF_9D65_427c_8B92_5E168ACFE497">PointCloud</fmt-xref> «FeatureType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_8f7e5f03-89b4-ea51-dec8-b4a1643d2668" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_8f7e5f03-89b4-ea51-dec8-b4a1643d2668"><p id="_4371287a-5b46-8278-7065-a89554987768" semx-id="_4371287a-5b46-8278-7065-a89554987768">A PointCloud is an unordered collection of points that is a sampling of the geometry of a space or space boundary.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

<table id="_69ae230c-e61f-3dbe-1a42-9cd73ad33e9e" semx-id="_69ae230c-e61f-3dbe-1a42-9cd73ad33e9e" autonum="37"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="75%"/></colgroup>
