</td>
<td id="_c5b9a0d9-480f-0625-3a95-2b6bd0591a5f" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_c5b9a0d9-480f-0625-3a95-2b6bd0591a5f"><p id="_1aef21d0-3188-050b-f413-8524f76c45bf" semx-id="_1aef21d0-3188-050b-f413-8524f76c45bf">ADEOfPointCloud acts as a hook to define properties within an ADE that are to be added to a PointCloud.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
