</td>
</tr><tr id="_66f2070f-1a87-9084-3228-6a543169fbd2" semx-id="_66f2070f-1a87-9084-3228-6a543169fbd2"><td id="_e38ec541-fc3f-fc94-e44f-f1288066459a" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_e38ec541-fc3f-fc94-e44f-f1288066459a"><p id="_d923913e-f3e4-4c79-0a4a-41c65089ee8f" semx-id="_d923913e-f3e4-4c79-0a4a-41c65089ee8f"><xref target="section-EAID_90C1991A_7C36_4b51_B5DD_F6A570100375" id="_268bbc9c-e8de-bc16-66ca-e8e261647f62">ReliefFeature</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_90C1991A_7C36_4b51_B5DD_F6A570100375">ReliefFeature</fmt-xref> «TopLevelFeatureType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_79d66115-8282-659c-9343-f61f21e11ba9" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_79d66115-8282-659c-9343-f61f21e11ba9"><p id="_f230a296-e7c6-29a1-ebf5-06de2a4c8c7a" semx-id="_f230a296-e7c6-29a1-ebf5-06de2a4c8c7a">A ReliefFeature is a collection of terrain components representing the Earth’s surface, also known as the Digital Terrain Model.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_d04c6cb8-5155-e696-759e-ce91fe1fa3c4" semx-id="_d04c6cb8-5155-e696-759e-ce91fe1fa3c4"><td id="_80614ce9-346b-fa3d-ced4-2fffe78e629b" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_80614ce9-346b-fa3d-ced4-2fffe78e629b"><p id="_91ffd398-45c5-b0df-a143-477fb322485b" semx-id="_91ffd398-45c5-b0df-a143-477fb322485b"><xref target="section-EAID_691F1836_DD16_45c0_9978_FABBA6CE23B4" id="_67e86b01-69f7-5c1a-ee5c-675a7451c6fc">TINRelief</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_691F1836_DD16_45c0_9978_FABBA6CE23B4">TINRelief</fmt-xref> «FeatureType»</p>
</td>
<td id="_0b81e688-1450-a501-4b37-11fd1b48bfa2" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_0b81e688-1450-a501-4b37-11fd1b48bfa2"><p id="_85b533d7-ea3b-4cff-9c7f-6f9c61b518ed" semx-id="_85b533d7-ea3b-4cff-9c7f-6f9c61b518ed">A TINRelief represents a terrain component as a triangulated irregular network.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

