<p id="_c5928494-bca0-dd23-925e-b83f51e9a6cb" semx-id="_c5928494-bca0-dd23-925e-b83f51e9a6cb">The ADE data types provided for the Transportation module are illustrated in <xref target="transportation-uml-ade-types" id="_9eca9202-fb28-e9d2-1297-7502debcd563"/><fmt-xref target="transportation-uml-ade-types"><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 48</fmt-xref>.</p>

