<clause id="section-EAPK_D44D446F_8AF9_49d7_BD32_6DA30532A847" anchor="section-EAPK_D44D446F_8AF9_49d7_BD32_6DA30532A847" obligation="normative" semx-id="_69efb6b1-3c52-0e8b-6352-0d446e8b08cc">
<title id="_4f23a317-6997-bc60-b3d6-3c07dbd37af1" semx-id="_781e2c0a-8ac4-cc9d-16b1-40ead31be95c">Vegetation</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_f7553ae3-ed86-a604-38e5-048fe989f4d1"><span class="fmt-caption-label">7<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>12<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_4f23a317-6997-bc60-b3d6-3c07dbd37af1">Vegetation</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 7<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>12</fmt-xref-label>
<requirement id="_ee4a7536-1a93-4ea7-8d6b-121b2238abed" anchor="rc_vegetation" model="ogc" type="class" semx-id="_11cced99-efd3-90c7-896e-2d9da5694fca" autonum="11" original-id="rc_vegetation"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirements class</span> 11</fmt-xref-label><inherit id="_0827eff2-a61d-4474-b460-6ae584fc38dc"><xref target="rc_core">/req/req-class-core</xref></inherit> <subject id="_87c25fa5-dbc8-4f36-a826-5b4313952b23">Implementation Specification</subject>

<fmt-provision id="_46d9c11b-bd70-5269-fc76-a34bd8e6fda0"><table id="rc_vegetation" type="recommendclass" class="modspec"><thead><tr><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2"><p class="RecommendationTitle"><fmt-name id="_b9c5ef18-df78-1b80-da98-287aac4d5f60"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Requirements class</span> 11</span></fmt-name></p></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><th>Target type</th><td><semx element="subject" source="_87c25fa5-dbc8-4f36-a826-5b4313952b23">Implementation Specification</semx></td></tr><tr><th>Prerequisite</th><td><semx element="inherit" source="_0827eff2-a61d-4474-b460-6ae584fc38dc"><xref target="rc_core" id="_6dd9e41f-ed5e-84e4-32a1-fb51b809ac3c">/req/req-class-core</xref><fmt-xref target="rc_core">/req/req-class-core</fmt-xref></semx></td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></requirement>

<p id="_38752ed0-4ac1-8699-f660-829a7390b4fb" semx-id="_38752ed0-4ac1-8699-f660-829a7390b4fb">The Vegetation module defines the concepts to represent vegetation within city models. Vegetation can be represented either as solitary vegetation objects, such as trees, bushes and ferns, or as vegetation areas that are covered by plants of a given species or a typical mixture of plant species, such as forests, steppes and wet meadows. Vegetation is represented in the UML model by the top-level feature types  <em>SolitaryVegetationObject</em> and <em>PlantCover</em>, which are also the only classes of the Vegetation module.</p>

<p id="_d1016e67-8d00-5e37-5b28-c2954e5af84a" semx-id="_d1016e67-8d00-5e37-5b28-c2954e5af84a">The UML diagram of the Vegetation module is depicted in <xref target="vegetation-uml" id="_ec65b079-3a26-6cb2-a2f9-22cea2057972"/><fmt-xref target="vegetation-uml"><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 50</fmt-xref>. A detailed discussion of this Requirements Class can be found in the  <link target="http://docs.opengeospatial.org/DRAFTS/20-066.html#ug-model-vegetation-section" id="_3016279f-5de7-15ae-6102-f23605105eb1">OGC CityGML 3.0 Users Guide</link><fmt-link target="http://docs.opengeospatial.org/DRAFTS/20-066.html#ug-model-vegetation-section">OGC CityGML 3.0 Users Guide</fmt-link>.</p>

<figure id="vegetation-uml" anchor="vegetation-uml" semx-id="_26a8519d-63ee-9644-1caf-a5e992c53afb" autonum="50">
<name id="_97012100-75a9-c9f2-faff-bf99565f32d1" semx-id="_e61c97a8-9aff-9c98-7c68-4eea12537c00">UML diagram of the Vegetation Model.</name><fmt-name id="_5c320ffe-d0b5-a2d4-28c2-47921296029d"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 50</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"> — </span><semx element="name" source="_97012100-75a9-c9f2-faff-bf99565f32d1">UML diagram of the Vegetation Model.</semx></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 50</fmt-xref-label>
<image id="_3ecef112-759e-12b8-678d-001eb6c7bd64" src="/__w/ogc-citygml-xmi/ogc-citygml-xmi/_site/documents/standard/_tmp_images_77d3242a-680f-4d67-85ca-3c09a9100559/40556c6a-7b08-4c13-9bde-2efbfc03b71f.png" extracted="true" mimetype="image/png" height="auto" width="auto" filename="figures/Vegetation.png" semx-id="_3ecef112-759e-12b8-678d-001eb6c7bd64"/></figure>

<p id="_839464d3-7e7a-293e-26f6-30a013a5da15" semx-id="_839464d3-7e7a-293e-26f6-30a013a5da15">The ADE data types provided for the Vegetation module are illustrated in <xref target="vegetation-uml-ade-types" id="_d938e15d-b57f-8f31-d1a2-b3ad2980a676"/><fmt-xref target="vegetation-uml-ade-types"><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 51</fmt-xref>.</p>

