<name id="_09736d2d-93d7-76bf-a9b2-52075ef96a6f" semx-id="_121ac8d9-9f5d-96ca-0223-b025cdf91291">ADE classes of the CityGML Vegetation module.</name><fmt-name id="_078a5489-0eae-9727-2de4-101d5fc98cbc"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 51</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"> — </span><semx element="name" source="_09736d2d-93d7-76bf-a9b2-52075ef96a6f">ADE classes of the CityGML Vegetation module.</semx></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 51</fmt-xref-label>
