<p id="_6d4a7378-2fc0-08e9-bda7-37edf7949686" semx-id="_6d4a7378-2fc0-08e9-bda7-37edf7949686">The Code Lists provided for the Vegetation module are illustrated in <xref target="vegetation-uml-codelists" id="_8f4ce4bc-03cb-8b54-e9a5-6846ff51ba09"/><fmt-xref target="vegetation-uml-codelists"><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 52</fmt-xref>.</p>

