<th id="_bedbb59a-5ae9-e9e8-36fe-42e96f747694" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_bedbb59a-5ae9-e9e8-36fe-42e96f747694">Description</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody><tr id="_b9a799ee-bb74-42d8-1cfe-3fff1d335e4b" semx-id="_b9a799ee-bb74-42d8-1cfe-3fff1d335e4b"><td id="_9a16c8d2-c417-321c-97e9-6fd01bb4d391" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_9a16c8d2-c417-321c-97e9-6fd01bb4d391"><p id="_4a4f33c3-e104-d591-8e8f-57d504f9b046" semx-id="_4a4f33c3-e104-d591-8e8f-57d504f9b046"><xref target="section-EAID_058951C4_50B2_4c9f_A9DA_03F47EF70F8D" id="_9b50fb59-8bf4-eb84-3b90-22d2aa13bd50">TransactionTypeValue</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_058951C4_50B2_4c9f_A9DA_03F47EF70F8D">TransactionTypeValue</fmt-xref> «Enumeration»</p>
</td>
<td id="_df33d772-ef8d-24a1-471a-634f9fb2ec23" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_df33d772-ef8d-24a1-471a-634f9fb2ec23"><p id="_81a1eae0-ccfd-cca1-71b9-7bf0cafa3f33" semx-id="_81a1eae0-ccfd-cca1-71b9-7bf0cafa3f33">TransactionTypeValue enumerates the three possible types of transactions: insert, delete, or replace.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_496ec6f2-7d2b-b7b8-d925-42a56f547bc4" semx-id="_496ec6f2-7d2b-b7b8-d925-42a56f547bc4"><td id="_e458ce66-8b04-3eed-6c48-c28f5e654962" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_e458ce66-8b04-3eed-6c48-c28f5e654962"><p id="_b498ed86-1ef9-afe4-2dc1-5e6d605c2a72" semx-id="_b498ed86-1ef9-afe4-2dc1-5e6d605c2a72"><xref target="section-EAID_431C75BD_FA6C_4196_97C7_F968E1945B63" id="_a6ff7d4c-ad03-e887-60ec-213d1996939f">TransitionTypeValue</xref><fmt-xref target="section-EAID_431C75BD_FA6C_4196_97C7_F968E1945B63">TransitionTypeValue</fmt-xref> «Enumeration»</p>
</td>
<td id="_fa0b162f-e6ca-b623-b8f6-3896a40c21a6" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_fa0b162f-e6ca-b623-b8f6-3896a40c21a6"><p id="_6b30bedd-ea80-eaa9-6e9f-463678da3db8" semx-id="_6b30bedd-ea80-eaa9-6e9f-463678da3db8">TransitionTypeValue enumerates the different kinds of version transitions. ?planned? and ?fork? should be used in cases when from one city model version multiple successor versions are being created. ?realized? and ?merge? should be used when different city model versions are converging into a common successor version.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>
</clause>

<clause id="_9a0faf26-8b88-fcca-d2a5-840c3ef1aab5" obligation="normative" semx-id="_9a0faf26-8b88-fcca-d2a5-840c3ef1aab5">
