<p id="_d01f8cdc-07fd-093c-ba61-769da8559e8e" semx-id="_d01f8cdc-07fd-093c-ba61-769da8559e8e"><xref target="waterbody-boundaries-table" id="_ec021c32-f763-66ae-a308-6c8bd86c805c"/><fmt-xref target="waterbody-boundaries-table"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 52</fmt-xref> lists the surfaces that are allowed as thematic surface boundaries of the space classes defined in the WaterBody module:</p>

<table id="waterbody-boundaries-table" anchor="waterbody-boundaries-table" semx-id="_b9a8c43a-1487-c4fd-e3d5-ee646aa0d7ac" autonum="52"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="75%"/></colgroup>
