<clause id="_395d243b-b161-1c6b-0378-a5b8140eeb28" obligation="normative" semx-id="_395d243b-b161-1c6b-0378-a5b8140eeb28">
<title id="_11b99dc6-f014-603c-d4ca-cfde38b02f31" semx-id="_3f12d583-ce8b-3e29-5606-f1915d7042c8">Additional Information</title><fmt-title depth="3" id="_ac55fbff-e507-666b-b97b-35dce6fc1549"><span class="fmt-caption-label">7<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>17<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_11b99dc6-f014-603c-d4ca-cfde38b02f31">Additional Information</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 7<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>17<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_ca27f1de-54ec-1402-9319-978076ac42ae" semx-id="_ca27f1de-54ec-1402-9319-978076ac42ae">Additional information about the Building Module can be found in the <link target="http://docs.opengeospatial.org/DRAFTS/20-066.html#ug-model-building-section" id="_250d4b3e-aeb9-58fc-b668-87ba13a4a1f8">OGC CityGML 3.0 Users Guide</link><fmt-link target="http://docs.opengeospatial.org/DRAFTS/20-066.html#ug-model-building-section">OGC CityGML 3.0 Users Guide</fmt-link>.</p>
