<p id="_652000fb-cb86-2c00-a5bf-571d5e984863" semx-id="_652000fb-cb86-2c00-a5bf-571d5e984863">The Code Lists provided for the Tunnel module are illustrated in <xref target="tunnel-uml-codelists" id="_2d8e980e-5a4b-ab7a-1365-a32a679d58b5"/><fmt-xref target="tunnel-uml-codelists"><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 69</fmt-xref>.</p>

