<clause id="data-dictionary-section" anchor="data-dictionary-section" obligation="normative" semx-id="_058a8685-e5dc-f8be-1330-613d341c83a7" displayorder="17">
<title id="_b1646ca5-a03a-0763-9206-4983fcbbb949" semx-id="_93b8f4cc-398b-1502-fa77-196a764cd701">CityGML Data Dictionary</title><fmt-title depth="1" id="_a46a34b5-7148-0334-6881-73ea43393fa9"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_b1646ca5-a03a-0763-9206-4983fcbbb949">CityGML Data Dictionary</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_aff1c313-5ffe-db70-a096-25827b046705" semx-id="_aff1c313-5ffe-db70-a096-25827b046705">The CityGML UML model is the normative definition of the CityGML Conceptual Model. The Data Dictionary tables in this section were software generated from the UML model. As such, this section provides a normative representation of the CityGML Conceptual Model.</p>

<p id="_33f1c4d2-f6ed-e7cc-d940-dc19e01b8a3d" semx-id="_33f1c4d2-f6ed-e7cc-d940-dc19e01b8a3d">An alternate representation can be found in the Conceptual Model in <xref target="conceptual-model-section" id="_d7b7039c-fc32-aa83-787d-bfd2920f0d25"/><fmt-xref target="conceptual-model-section"><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 7</fmt-xref>.</p>

<figure id="data-dictionary-package-diagram" anchor="data-dictionary-package-diagram" semx-id="_67701718-19f2-ea15-e91d-82612272af7b" autonum="70">
<name id="_3fc824ed-1726-7666-a36c-67c4e7668c03" semx-id="_71b77a44-baa3-d425-0523-ef3c503b17db">CityGML UML Packages</name><fmt-name id="_feb6474d-5909-a204-2e5c-6d289d78c266"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 70</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"> — </span><semx element="name" source="_3fc824ed-1726-7666-a36c-67c4e7668c03">CityGML UML Packages</semx></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Figure</span> 70</fmt-xref-label>
<image id="_2b875f73-db54-137b-4d8b-cdbcb4d27c8a" src="/__w/ogc-citygml-xmi/ogc-citygml-xmi/_site/documents/standard/_tmp_images_77d3242a-680f-4d67-85ca-3c09a9100559/38d97f7a-c95b-4d2b-b910-c9e747cda46f.png" extracted="true" mimetype="image/png" height="auto" width="auto" filename="figures/CityGMLPackageDiagram.png" semx-id="_2b875f73-db54-137b-4d8b-cdbcb4d27c8a"/></figure>

<clause id="ISO-classes-dd" anchor="ISO-classes-dd" obligation="normative" semx-id="_233fa486-ecda-2cd4-50e4-2c360b5f7b4a">
<title id="_bb4e8000-cb87-c06d-78df-f9251803a0d9" semx-id="_e69fcac6-7335-53bb-e350-6a878b96b76d">ISO Classes</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_e13d2875-80ae-d92f-1664-ab88135cedc3"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_bb4e8000-cb87-c06d-78df-f9251803a0d9">ISO Classes</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_f1625b7d-47b1-c5d0-2784-0cc0ed919658" semx-id="_f1625b7d-47b1-c5d0-2784-0cc0ed919658">The following classes are defined in ISO standards and used by the CityGML Conceptual Model.</p>

<clause id="AnyFeature-section" anchor="AnyFeature-section" obligation="normative" semx-id="_228e879b-818e-87d7-3334-ad9f40ac9203">
<title id="_2d29b85e-4ef9-531e-87b8-0651232d5a2c" semx-id="_118fdedc-b823-7a16-8381-d773bf512e88">AnyFeature (from <eref type="inline" bibitemid="iso19109" citeas="ISO 19109:2015"/>)</title><fmt-title depth="3" id="_925702ee-5a03-2904-cb08-69b58578e182"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_2d29b85e-4ef9-531e-87b8-0651232d5a2c">AnyFeature (from <eref type="inline" bibitemid="iso19109" citeas="ISO 19109:2015" id="_664e8ff2-296d-2ead-ef42-8e650ba73312"/><fmt-xref type="inline" target="iso19109">ISO 19109:2015</fmt-xref>)</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1</fmt-xref-label>
<table id="_eff7236a-f827-b11e-86b6-3ff7764f635e" semx-id="_eff7236a-f827-b11e-86b6-3ff7764f635e" autonum="73"><colgroup><col width="20%"/><col width="80%"/></colgroup>
<name id="_7909ea50-1db1-7a66-8517-cc13ac991395" semx-id="_3b05c346-372e-56cd-f247-93e564ab8529">Metadata of AnyFeature (class)</name><fmt-name id="_e60835f1-4312-0cb1-3c1b-127259de3830"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 73</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"> — </span><semx element="name" source="_7909ea50-1db1-7a66-8517-cc13ac991395">Metadata of AnyFeature (class)</semx></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 73</fmt-xref-label>
<tbody><tr id="_9603c16e-bd29-3f7f-a5ef-c686f73c394b" semx-id="_9603c16e-bd29-3f7f-a5ef-c686f73c394b"><th id="_b631f13e-4ea7-91a9-ab91-929b89c743be" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_b631f13e-4ea7-91a9-ab91-929b89c743be">Definition:</th>
<td id="_dfe96362-edc7-5f1c-d1cf-f0faff0adb8c" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_dfe96362-edc7-5f1c-d1cf-f0faff0adb8c"><p id="_b29cb622-ab90-d473-9b57-0c4520e4d961" semx-id="_b29cb622-ab90-d473-9b57-0c4520e4d961">AnyFeature is an abstract class that is the generalization of all feature types. AnyFeature is an instance of the «metaclass» FeatureType [cf. ISO 19109].</p>
