</semx></fmt-concept></p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_7ac7d314-c209-eca0-08fc-e5f634db3e05" semx-id="_7ac7d314-c209-eca0-08fc-e5f634db3e05"><th id="_1e903f5c-a562-ae30-645f-c2753107d9de" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_1e903f5c-a562-ae30-645f-c2753107d9de">Stereotype:</th>
<td id="_e1c8854f-751a-539d-d963-f378426b0b58" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_e1c8854f-751a-539d-d963-f378426b0b58"><p id="_a2ecf498-5e4b-a8d5-67ba-939b2fc9a3ad" semx-id="_a2ecf498-5e4b-a8d5-67ba-939b2fc9a3ad">«type»</p>
