<tbody><tr id="_4c8dd058-7136-1f08-95e0-2c0ea60610b5" semx-id="_4c8dd058-7136-1f08-95e0-2c0ea60610b5"><td id="_c40b82ab-8839-924d-4a55-37fdfe615dab" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_c40b82ab-8839-924d-4a55-37fdfe615dab"><p id="_85ef9f0d-454e-16db-8849-6ef0a6938730" semx-id="_85ef9f0d-454e-16db-8849-6ef0a6938730">entirelyAboveWaterSurface</p>
</td>
<td id="_5941eb8f-c3d4-34a9-1ed6-947b9ec5f567" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_5941eb8f-c3d4-34a9-1ed6-947b9ec5f567"><p id="_c7e7d979-4ebc-3c9e-fd43-9d6c43fd9855" semx-id="_c7e7d979-4ebc-3c9e-fd43-9d6c43fd9855">Indicates that the city object is located entirely above the water surface.</p>
