<td id="_7bcbd65a-3b10-bc68-31ae-31206bc53bdb" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_7bcbd65a-3b10-bc68-31ae-31206bc53bdb"><p id="_3d74514a-bcf4-bc19-daf2-efd1c4ba295a" semx-id="_3d74514a-bcf4-bc19-daf2-efd1c4ba295a">Indicates that the city object is for the most part located below the water surface.</p>
