<td id="_06aa7644-8033-402c-7a8b-c1b384ccf874" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_06aa7644-8033-402c-7a8b-c1b384ccf874"><p id="_9a27112e-c7d3-1414-7469-a99e582d2113" semx-id="_9a27112e-c7d3-1414-7469-a99e582d2113">Indicates that the texture type is not known.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
