<title id="_863fabbc-040c-9a1e-b356-a76f358c0057" semx-id="_817a43c4-71ec-fbf0-5851-f6a096664986">CityFurniture</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_e8da3463-4004-0eb7-b2aa-58a75f45d8fd"><span class="fmt-caption-label">8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>4<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_863fabbc-040c-9a1e-b356-a76f358c0057">CityFurniture</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 8<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>4</fmt-xref-label>
