</td>
</tr><tr id="_695a53ce-c96a-1f6c-59b6-1c5e86098052" semx-id="_695a53ce-c96a-1f6c-59b6-1c5e86098052"><th id="_d6ba9b5c-e4ae-617b-0ae0-c36d37f13009" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_d6ba9b5c-e4ae-617b-0ae0-c36d37f13009">Stereotype:</th>
<td id="_851432a3-b85d-991e-62d0-c6bb59df6bcf" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_851432a3-b85d-991e-62d0-c6bb59df6bcf"><p id="_8227c6c7-0eb2-61ab-9c82-4abbd4d81b60" semx-id="_8227c6c7-0eb2-61ab-9c82-4abbd4d81b60">«ApplicationSchema»</p>
