<td id="_dbded22a-38be-80ab-5824-99c610f027d8" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_dbded22a-38be-80ab-5824-99c610f027d8"><p id="_c2ef046e-747c-3139-f045-550bfff78f4e" semx-id="_c2ef046e-747c-3139-f045-550bfff78f4e">The CityObjectGroup module supports grouping of city objects. Arbitrary city objects may be aggregated in groups according to user-defined criteria. A group may be further classified by application-specific attributes.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_22b61849-4d1f-cfd5-cda3-20ef90c98b3b" semx-id="_22b61849-4d1f-cfd5-cda3-20ef90c98b3b"><th id="_1c0aeb07-58f1-7bad-b9c2-8c6fe0dd648a" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_1c0aeb07-58f1-7bad-b9c2-8c6fe0dd648a">Parent package:</th>
