</td>
</tr><tr id="_fc8e8a8d-e4f4-3c99-9e79-765842ed8c3f" semx-id="_fc8e8a8d-e4f4-3c99-9e79-765842ed8c3f"><th id="_2814a7c0-4b33-d57d-3c82-218854ad2c76" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_2814a7c0-4b33-d57d-3c82-218854ad2c76">Stereotype:</th>
<td id="_5399e5c6-3105-73b1-9e28-bf19913ec12c" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_5399e5c6-3105-73b1-9e28-bf19913ec12c"><p id="_6007ad78-d21b-5a9a-afb8-5f996accbbdc" semx-id="_6007ad78-d21b-5a9a-afb8-5f996accbbdc">«FeatureType»</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

