<td id="_52fdb262-fbf6-5a04-c791-48bbbf2dccd9" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_52fdb262-fbf6-5a04-c791-48bbbf2dccd9"><p id="_386d6610-5536-eec4-a0cd-65259b024c40" semx-id="_386d6610-5536-eec4-a0cd-65259b024c40">The Generics module supports application-specific extensions to the CityGML conceptual model. These extensions may be used to model and exchange additional attributes and features not covered by the predefined thematic classes of CityGML. Generic extensions shall only be used if appropriate thematic classes or attributes are not provided by any other CityGML module.</p>
</td>
