<tbody><tr id="_6900d031-1797-a446-0f51-919dff6ee85c" semx-id="_6900d031-1797-a446-0f51-919dff6ee85c"><td id="_374208e8-8da5-0545-db32-ac0a113d365c" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_374208e8-8da5-0545-db32-ac0a113d365c"><p id="_c6537516-46aa-15be-daf5-c8b64b0fb5c1" semx-id="_c6537516-46aa-15be-daf5-c8b64b0fb5c1">insert</p>
</td>
<td id="_99fa66dc-4e7d-db00-3c1f-52d48d6a5014" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_99fa66dc-4e7d-db00-3c1f-52d48d6a5014"><p id="_f543ca31-b087-368a-3aa3-96a242638ea3" semx-id="_f543ca31-b087-368a-3aa3-96a242638ea3">Indicates that the feature referenced from the Transaction via the “newFeature” association has been newly created; the association “oldFeature” is empty in this case.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_8fc6e4c8-94e9-9da1-f6cf-794dd119ab08" semx-id="_8fc6e4c8-94e9-9da1-f6cf-794dd119ab08"><td id="_3a0f3c79-747c-94cb-62d9-e9f7011928ce" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_3a0f3c79-747c-94cb-62d9-e9f7011928ce"><p id="_a4349419-0e49-a325-5612-87e6766ea454" semx-id="_a4349419-0e49-a325-5612-87e6766ea454">delete</p>
</td>
<td id="_df330145-93f6-c088-eac5-e16a6fdd3bd1" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_df330145-93f6-c088-eac5-e16a6fdd3bd1"><p id="_1fd6c3bb-1d17-4f60-ef85-d3d61cb53d5e" semx-id="_1fd6c3bb-1d17-4f60-ef85-d3d61cb53d5e">Indicates that the feature referenced from the Transaction via the “oldFeature” association ceases to exist; the association “newFeature” is empty in this case.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_88375f9e-4ee2-efcf-c550-e70bee6e5089" semx-id="_88375f9e-4ee2-efcf-c550-e70bee6e5089"><td id="_d5990942-cea1-59b9-5cda-8feaf75dade5" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_d5990942-cea1-59b9-5cda-8feaf75dade5"><p id="_ec2e5bfc-ce82-bc35-8617-26777643da63" semx-id="_ec2e5bfc-ce82-bc35-8617-26777643da63">replace</p>
</td>
<td id="_1f138671-e2b6-dc6a-1c91-f6729a295140" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_1f138671-e2b6-dc6a-1c91-f6729a295140"><p id="_d0c65fe4-ca5b-0734-f5c8-5f88a1dc0a2b" semx-id="_d0c65fe4-ca5b-0734-f5c8-5f88a1dc0a2b">Indicates that the feature referenced from the Transaction via the “oldFeature” association has been replaced by the feature referenced via the “newFeature” association.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>
</clause>

