<td id="_cff9e869-c0b5-336b-666e-231acc78df5c" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_cff9e869-c0b5-336b-666e-231acc78df5c"><p id="_fa15754b-4c80-f9d8-35c3-e57208bfb093" semx-id="_fa15754b-4c80-f9d8-35c3-e57208bfb093">The WaterBody module supports representation of the thematic aspects and 3D geometry of rivers, canals, lakes, and basins. It does, however, not inherit any hydrological or other dynamic aspects of fluid flow.</p>
</td>
