<th id="_42b5d623-cb74-e0d2-40fa-bdb2f574a447" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_42b5d623-cb74-e0d2-40fa-bdb2f574a447">ConditionOfConstructionValue enumerates different conditions of a construction. [cf. INSPIRE]</th>
