</td>
<td id="_52c04f82-b301-3bd6-9517-a8bf8b5c6de5" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_52c04f82-b301-3bd6-9517-a8bf8b5c6de5"><p id="_96d1e297-82a0-6de7-9274-20e88658d73f" semx-id="_96d1e297-82a0-6de7-9274-20e88658d73f">Indicates that the height has been estimated and not measured. [cf. INSPIRE]</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_e27a07bf-3070-5a71-fb9d-ac18997b1c47" semx-id="_e27a07bf-3070-5a71-fb9d-ac18997b1c47"><td id="_e8ec8905-3e16-d3bc-a46c-2e3c8ffe6d4c" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_e8ec8905-3e16-d3bc-a46c-2e3c8ffe6d4c"><p id="_bea6531f-0288-2fb5-abdc-7eac07516b42" semx-id="_bea6531f-0288-2fb5-abdc-7eac07516b42">measured</p>
