<td id="_2b7b9559-aece-fba9-5fdc-446c46890e03" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_2b7b9559-aece-fba9-5fdc-446c46890e03"><p id="_9dff0414-9ea7-c306-83d6-0956bedb111a" semx-id="_9dff0414-9ea7-c306-83d6-0956bedb111a">Indicates that the height has been (directly or indirectly) measured. [cf. INSPIRE]</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
