<td id="_9befd4de-5fdc-2380-f43e-52fcf239236b" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_9befd4de-5fdc-2380-f43e-52fcf239236b"><p id="_9a89301a-1523-e89d-2df4-83dc4f810bed" semx-id="_9a89301a-1523-e89d-2df4-83dc4f810bed">A BridgeInstallation is a permanent part of a Bridge (inside and/or outside) which does not have the significance of a BridgePart. In contrast to BridgeConstructiveElements, a BridgeInstallation is not essential from a structural point of view. Examples are stairs, antennas or railways.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_59539739-a650-ce2f-2878-455dde4d98f0" semx-id="_59539739-a650-ce2f-2878-455dde4d98f0"><th id="_6a468ce1-544a-f20c-0745-2385abdac8b5" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_6a468ce1-544a-f20c-0745-2385abdac8b5">Subclass of:</th>
