</td>
</tr><tr id="_f767c6ac-3564-6329-86fb-bc416f56e823" semx-id="_f767c6ac-3564-6329-86fb-bc416f56e823"><th id="_ad8fab0e-813e-f694-700c-bc481ecbc380" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_ad8fab0e-813e-f694-700c-bc481ecbc380">Stereotype:</th>
