<td id="_f8d15f8c-98a9-8736-b83a-1389b0c64ef9" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_f8d15f8c-98a9-8736-b83a-1389b0c64ef9"><p id="_168c191d-9cac-631b-df10-e9917a09fe4a" semx-id="_168c191d-9cac-631b-df10-e9917a09fe4a">A BridgeRoom is a space within a Bridge or BridgePart intended for human occupancy (e.g. a place of work or recreation) and/or containment (storage) of animals or things. A BridgeRoom is bounded physically and/or virtually (e.g. by ClosureSurfaces or GenericSurfaces).</p>
