<td id="_76bf937b-c798-443e-6b74-48ef6b4b9053" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_76bf937b-c798-443e-6b74-48ef6b4b9053"><p id="_dfc5ff3f-b619-d73b-1246-cd4dc1c37963" semx-id="_dfc5ff3f-b619-d73b-1246-cd4dc1c37963">A Building is a free-standing, self-supporting construction that is roofed, usually walled, and can be entered by humans and is normally designed to stand permanently in one place. It is intended for human occupancy (e.g. a place of work or recreation), habitation and/or shelter of humans, animals or things.</p>
