<name id="_40aaeae7-2ec3-feb1-cd3f-ad3417d49c9d" semx-id="_9c56a167-53cb-7c4e-3216-03cc0bf41415">Metadata of BuildingRoom («FeatureType»)</name><fmt-name id="_3fea5e37-41f2-fde7-d254-5e41a4117f1a"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 715</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"> — </span><semx element="name" source="_40aaeae7-2ec3-feb1-cd3f-ad3417d49c9d">Metadata of BuildingRoom («FeatureType»)</semx></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 715</fmt-xref-label>
<tbody><tr id="_6634adfa-1d52-1ea7-ee6e-232881318980" semx-id="_6634adfa-1d52-1ea7-ee6e-232881318980"><th id="_465afb97-6eab-24e1-016c-aa4593f47c73" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_465afb97-6eab-24e1-016c-aa4593f47c73">Definition:</th>
<td id="_4cbb235c-f52f-b29e-4512-6ca0b98a1aaa" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_4cbb235c-f52f-b29e-4512-6ca0b98a1aaa"><p id="_5d76e0b9-4f67-41af-f4bb-7cb30bdc110e" semx-id="_5d76e0b9-4f67-41af-f4bb-7cb30bdc110e">A BuildingRoom is a space within a Building or BuildingPart intended for human occupancy (e.g. a place of work or recreation) and/or containment of animals or things. A BuildingRoom is bounded physically and/or virtually (e.g. by ClosureSurfaces or GenericSurfaces).</p>
