<bibitem id="iso19143" type="standard" schema-version="v1.5.6" anchor="iso19143" semx-id="_e615a23f-9d15-cac1-d4fd-e86433093612"><biblio-tag/><formattedref>International Organization for Standardization (committee): ISO 19143:2010, <em>Geographic information — Filter encoding</em>. International Organization for Standardization, Geneva (2010). <fmt-link target="https://www.iso.org/standard/42137.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/42137.html</fmt-link>.</formattedref>
  <fetched>2026-08-11</fetched>
  
