  <abstract language="en" script="Latn">
    <p id="_c74d3aa7-c63c-6dd0-a1d0-14533799b1ae" semx-id="_c74d3aa7-c63c-6dd0-a1d0-14533799b1ae">This second document defines the general structure of the MIME media typing system and defines an initial set of media types. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p>

  </abstract>
