<title id="_fb01f828-011d-f54f-1205-d0f19e81e52e" semx-id="_b1f5e830-a1d4-0369-43b6-90965c1d4a0a">Conformance Class Relief</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_2d58eafd-2f46-c780-8b6a-d959266d5336"><span class="fmt-caption-label">A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>10<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_fb01f828-011d-f54f-1205-d0f19e81e52e">Conformance Class Relief</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Annex</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>10</fmt-xref-label>
