<component exclude="false" class="test-purpose" original-id="_6495e86f-41e6-48c2-a66b-1d759d97c1ae"><p semx-id="_ed3e48b0-5e5c-c792-a627-f9baecace636" original-id="_ed3e48b0-5e5c-c792-a627-f9baecace636">To validate that the Implementation Specification correctly implements the UML Classes defined in the Conceptual Model.</p>
</component>
