<clause id="_31669374-b83a-f66d-061b-f3927ece9486" obligation="normative" semx-id="_31669374-b83a-f66d-061b-f3927ece9486" autonum="A.19">
<title id="_789d1f47-a46d-5e9c-d56c-60377b24a102" semx-id="_353b5d69-b638-f238-575d-b6f0c97f2194">Conformance Class ADE</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_5175c520-cfdd-f96e-f8d8-8e758a1a2e34"><span class="fmt-caption-label">A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>19<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_789d1f47-a46d-5e9c-d56c-60377b24a102">Conformance Class ADE</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Annex</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>19</fmt-xref-label>
<requirement id="_affbceec-9b40-4831-a386-75e503af4462" anchor="ats_ade_uml" model="ogc" type="abstracttest" semx-id="_74096c2d-7928-ceba-9a28-fc62447fa892" autonum="A.48" original-id="ats_ade_uml"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>48</fmt-xref-label><subject id="_7f80b269-e508-4436-9033-70a5c3b8b796">&lt;xref target=”req_ade_uml” type=”inline”&gt;/req/ade/uml&lt;/xref&gt;</subject>
<component exclude="false" class="test-purpose" original-id="_a2feea72-cad4-4e3c-8afe-30025af3f38c"><p semx-id="_a125f671-4db3-5519-4ff6-e8eb9d95ff6f" original-id="_a125f671-4db3-5519-4ff6-e8eb9d95ff6f">To validate that Application Domain Extensions (ADE) to the CityGML Conceptual Model are modeled correctly in UML.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="test method type" original-id="_31edf10e-dc98-4a75-9526-77847365ae6f"><p semx-id="_614b8874-06b3-3beb-120e-8423d51967ca" original-id="_614b8874-06b3-3beb-120e-8423d51967ca">Manual Inspection</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="test method" original-id="_3eec6428-6855-4374-a00b-3e1c801ed561"><component exclude="false" class="step" id="_fb8e2dd6-57da-4b0f-ab6c-f710d71fab4f"><p semx-id="_d0c028d4-c04d-f5e3-93dd-8fcf51ad640c" id="_d0c028d4-c04d-f5e3-93dd-8fcf51ad640c">An ADE is defined as conceptual model in UML in accordance with the conceptual modeling framework of the ISO 19100 series of International Standards</p>

<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_3348afc7-b8e3-429f-9542-04858750d430"><p semx-id="_dffd0ffe-be1b-b6c7-36ff-0da3d37e85c4" id="_dffd0ffe-be1b-b6c7-36ff-0da3d37e85c4">Validate that the ADE UML model adheres to the General Feature Model as specified in ISO 19109.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_22dd3834-6080-41ba-b882-0cd6f56780a6"><p semx-id="_80f92315-a0e4-7f71-e1a1-e46e06f9fed2" id="_80f92315-a0e4-7f71-e1a1-e46e06f9fed2">Validate that the ADE UML model adheres to rules and constraints for application schemas as specified in ISO/TS 19103.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_c12807db-3bea-41e8-8e1b-7ba4df2c05c7"><p semx-id="_a4f32133-13c0-c388-6f0b-1d6950ad48ce" id="_a4f32133-13c0-c388-6f0b-1d6950ad48ce">Validate that the ADE UML model is organized into one or more UML packages having globally unique namespaces and containing all UML model elements defined by the ADE.</p>
</component></component></component><fmt-provision id="_60d5a12b-8681-26ab-7abf-fccb768a8791"><table id="ats_ade_uml" type="recommendtest" class="modspec"><thead><tr><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2"><p class="RecommendationTestTitle"><fmt-name id="_c49f6571-c87c-75d2-c83c-0e6dba1871af"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>48</span></fmt-name></p></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><th>Subject</th><td><semx element="subject" source="_7f80b269-e508-4436-9033-70a5c3b8b796">&lt;xref target=”req_ade_uml” type=”inline”&gt;/req/ade/uml&lt;/xref&gt;</semx></td></tr><tr id="_a2feea72-cad4-4e3c-8afe-30025af3f38c"><th>Test purpose</th><td><semx element="component" source="_a2feea72-cad4-4e3c-8afe-30025af3f38c"><p id="_a125f671-4db3-5519-4ff6-e8eb9d95ff6f" semx-id="_a125f671-4db3-5519-4ff6-e8eb9d95ff6f">To validate that Application Domain Extensions (ADE) to the CityGML Conceptual Model are modeled correctly in UML.</p>
</semx></td></tr><tr id="_31edf10e-dc98-4a75-9526-77847365ae6f"><th>Test method type</th><td><semx element="component" source="_31edf10e-dc98-4a75-9526-77847365ae6f"><p id="_614b8874-06b3-3beb-120e-8423d51967ca" semx-id="_614b8874-06b3-3beb-120e-8423d51967ca">Manual Inspection</p>
</semx></td></tr><tr id="_3eec6428-6855-4374-a00b-3e1c801ed561"><th>Test method</th><td><semx element="component" source="_3eec6428-6855-4374-a00b-3e1c801ed561"><ol class="steps"><li><semx element="component" source="_fb8e2dd6-57da-4b0f-ab6c-f710d71fab4f"><p semx-id="_d0c028d4-c04d-f5e3-93dd-8fcf51ad640c" original-id="_d0c028d4-c04d-f5e3-93dd-8fcf51ad640c">An ADE is defined as conceptual model in UML in accordance with the conceptual modeling framework of the ISO 19100 series of International Standards</p>

<ol class="steps"><li><semx element="component" source="_3348afc7-b8e3-429f-9542-04858750d430"><p semx-id="_dffd0ffe-be1b-b6c7-36ff-0da3d37e85c4" original-id="_dffd0ffe-be1b-b6c7-36ff-0da3d37e85c4">Validate that the ADE UML model adheres to the General Feature Model as specified in ISO 19109.</p>
</semx></li><li><semx element="component" source="_22dd3834-6080-41ba-b882-0cd6f56780a6"><p semx-id="_80f92315-a0e4-7f71-e1a1-e46e06f9fed2" original-id="_80f92315-a0e4-7f71-e1a1-e46e06f9fed2">Validate that the ADE UML model adheres to rules and constraints for application schemas as specified in ISO/TS 19103.</p>
</semx></li><li><semx element="component" source="_c12807db-3bea-41e8-8e1b-7ba4df2c05c7"><p semx-id="_a4f32133-13c0-c388-6f0b-1d6950ad48ce" original-id="_a4f32133-13c0-c388-6f0b-1d6950ad48ce">Validate that the ADE UML model is organized into one or more UML packages having globally unique namespaces and containing all UML model elements defined by the ADE.</p>
</semx></li></ol>

</semx></li></ol></semx></td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></requirement>

<requirement id="_40dde56b-1120-43a0-ad4e-12266ef46247" anchor="ats_ade_elements" model="ogc" type="abstracttest" semx-id="_74173ee6-72c5-669e-2397-9abc7eb606dc" autonum="A.49" original-id="ats_ade_elements"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>49</fmt-xref-label><subject id="_e2eb6683-5df5-427d-aa97-647ce9325e86">&lt;xref target=”req_ade_elements” type=”inline”&gt;/req/ade/elements&lt;/xref&gt;</subject>
<component exclude="false" class="test-purpose" original-id="_ab965977-fea4-4640-9498-d72f04daca07"><p semx-id="_afd27432-c77d-c965-621a-db0fc51d43b2" original-id="_afd27432-c77d-c965-621a-db0fc51d43b2">To validate that Application Domain Extension s (ADE) to the CityGML Conceptual Model are implemented correctly.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="test method type" original-id="_c915c786-be67-477d-9736-be7e9514505c"><p semx-id="_2f20c53f-d51c-2fcf-a5d4-96b2461a289c" original-id="_2f20c53f-d51c-2fcf-a5d4-96b2461a289c">Manual Inspection</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="test method" original-id="_8b44ca40-453c-4268-a918-cbcb18432a37"><component exclude="false" class="step" id="_5477de44-ca1d-4e78-a8ea-22a1bdf1ec34"><p semx-id="_995b8e23-2bfe-1a2e-66d3-a5f4b0e4b114" id="_995b8e23-2bfe-1a2e-66d3-a5f4b0e4b114">For each new UML class defined by an ADE:</p>

<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_e88917cc-fb51-47ba-a13c-85ebdae98d6c"><p semx-id="_f93197ef-5bc1-81f8-054c-b74b8c1a11e2" id="_f93197ef-5bc1-81f8-054c-b74b8c1a11e2">Validate that every Feature Type class in an ADE is derived either directly or indirectly from the CityGML root Feature Type <em>core:AbstractFeature</em> or a subclass thereof.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_0276d3ed-5715-45b2-861d-7bd2a12483c3"><p semx-id="_1f58f0a0-9def-9242-41e4-215abc031623" id="_1f58f0a0-9def-9242-41e4-215abc031623">Validate that every UML class in an ADE which represents a top-level Feature Type is assigned the <em>«TopLevelFeatureType»</em> stereotype.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_389a73db-9886-412c-8b77-cc840cfc958c"><p semx-id="_d07a71cf-343d-a1ba-8b73-c1b5b403b373" id="_d07a71cf-343d-a1ba-8b73-c1b5b403b373">Validate that every UML class in an ADE which represents spaces or space boundaries is derived either directly or indirectly from <em>core:AbstractSpace</em> or <em>core:AbstractSpaceBoundary</em> respectively.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_a302d4c3-77ce-4243-bc53-214b690ca9b9"><p semx-id="_e83ec0ba-f2b7-4e4c-1bd9-4859641d6ba5" id="_e83ec0ba-f2b7-4e4c-1bd9-4859641d6ba5">Validate that any new or additional spatial properties defined by an ADE:</p>

<ol type="arabic" semx-id="_6b9fe9a2-8a28-0eae-05ea-091806814d4b" id="_6b9fe9a2-8a28-0eae-05ea-091806814d4b"><li id="_0626f250-48df-3dc1-e8b3-c59d7ef8a1d5"><p semx-id="_06c88c79-e576-678d-24f7-d194ccce5a95" id="_06c88c79-e576-678d-24f7-d194ccce5a95">belongs to a predefined LOD,</p>
</li>
<li id="_39949d04-43f4-a166-9df5-6bc96eeb3847"><p semx-id="_ddd4d753-f03a-52cf-5a08-229cc99a45fb" id="_ddd4d753-f03a-52cf-5a08-229cc99a45fb">has a property name which starts with the prefix “lod<em>X</em>”, where <em>X</em> is an integer value indicating the target LOD.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</component></component></component><fmt-provision id="_f63cdfb3-d086-30e2-a1f7-d3f1bb957a4c"><table id="ats_ade_elements" type="recommendtest" class="modspec"><thead><tr><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2"><p class="RecommendationTestTitle"><fmt-name id="_cb168c46-9d26-da14-3a12-2e29f51edd5e"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>49</span></fmt-name></p></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><th>Subject</th><td><semx element="subject" source="_e2eb6683-5df5-427d-aa97-647ce9325e86">&lt;xref target=”req_ade_elements” type=”inline”&gt;/req/ade/elements&lt;/xref&gt;</semx></td></tr><tr id="_ab965977-fea4-4640-9498-d72f04daca07"><th>Test purpose</th><td><semx element="component" source="_ab965977-fea4-4640-9498-d72f04daca07"><p id="_afd27432-c77d-c965-621a-db0fc51d43b2" semx-id="_afd27432-c77d-c965-621a-db0fc51d43b2">To validate that Application Domain Extension s (ADE) to the CityGML Conceptual Model are implemented correctly.</p>
</semx></td></tr><tr id="_c915c786-be67-477d-9736-be7e9514505c"><th>Test method type</th><td><semx element="component" source="_c915c786-be67-477d-9736-be7e9514505c"><p id="_2f20c53f-d51c-2fcf-a5d4-96b2461a289c" semx-id="_2f20c53f-d51c-2fcf-a5d4-96b2461a289c">Manual Inspection</p>
</semx></td></tr><tr id="_8b44ca40-453c-4268-a918-cbcb18432a37"><th>Test method</th><td><semx element="component" source="_8b44ca40-453c-4268-a918-cbcb18432a37"><ol class="steps"><li><semx element="component" source="_5477de44-ca1d-4e78-a8ea-22a1bdf1ec34"><p semx-id="_995b8e23-2bfe-1a2e-66d3-a5f4b0e4b114" original-id="_995b8e23-2bfe-1a2e-66d3-a5f4b0e4b114">For each new UML class defined by an ADE:</p>

<ol class="steps"><li><semx element="component" source="_e88917cc-fb51-47ba-a13c-85ebdae98d6c"><p semx-id="_f93197ef-5bc1-81f8-054c-b74b8c1a11e2" original-id="_f93197ef-5bc1-81f8-054c-b74b8c1a11e2">Validate that every Feature Type class in an ADE is derived either directly or indirectly from the CityGML root Feature Type <em>core:AbstractFeature</em> or a subclass thereof.</p>
</semx></li><li><semx element="component" source="_0276d3ed-5715-45b2-861d-7bd2a12483c3"><p semx-id="_1f58f0a0-9def-9242-41e4-215abc031623" original-id="_1f58f0a0-9def-9242-41e4-215abc031623">Validate that every UML class in an ADE which represents a top-level Feature Type is assigned the <em>«TopLevelFeatureType»</em> stereotype.</p>
</semx></li><li><semx element="component" source="_389a73db-9886-412c-8b77-cc840cfc958c"><p semx-id="_d07a71cf-343d-a1ba-8b73-c1b5b403b373" original-id="_d07a71cf-343d-a1ba-8b73-c1b5b403b373">Validate that every UML class in an ADE which represents spaces or space boundaries is derived either directly or indirectly from <em>core:AbstractSpace</em> or <em>core:AbstractSpaceBoundary</em> respectively.</p>
</semx></li><li><semx element="component" source="_a302d4c3-77ce-4243-bc53-214b690ca9b9"><p semx-id="_e83ec0ba-f2b7-4e4c-1bd9-4859641d6ba5" original-id="_e83ec0ba-f2b7-4e4c-1bd9-4859641d6ba5">Validate that any new or additional spatial properties defined by an ADE:</p>

<ol type="arabic" semx-id="_6b9fe9a2-8a28-0eae-05ea-091806814d4b" original-id="_6b9fe9a2-8a28-0eae-05ea-091806814d4b"><li original-id="_370936ef-d9ac-615f-0215-fba5d31586a7"><fmt-name id="_dedc74a3-3a53-fcb2-6ad0-23ab56e21dda">1<span class="fmt-label-delim">.</span></fmt-name><p semx-id="_06c88c79-e576-678d-24f7-d194ccce5a95" original-id="_06c88c79-e576-678d-24f7-d194ccce5a95">belongs to a predefined LOD,</p>
</li>
<li original-id="_a4aca386-6207-f624-1613-b91819cb4754"><fmt-name id="_6cd660d0-56a1-8e2f-ef5e-1d417cbaae94">2<span class="fmt-label-delim">.</span></fmt-name><p semx-id="_ddd4d753-f03a-52cf-5a08-229cc99a45fb" original-id="_ddd4d753-f03a-52cf-5a08-229cc99a45fb">has a property name which starts with the prefix “lod<em>X</em>”, where <em>X</em> is an integer value indicating the target LOD.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</semx></li></ol>


</semx></li></ol></semx></td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></requirement>

<requirement id="_65ce7cc8-4dfd-41bd-950d-665eecb3699a" anchor="ats_ade_properties" model="ogc" type="abstracttest" semx-id="_66b43787-3062-3a69-5a3f-fd89092af084" autonum="A.50" original-id="ats_ade_properties"><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>50</fmt-xref-label><subject id="_34c74876-981b-4501-8b83-6127a8880371">&lt;xref target=”req_ade_properties” type=”inline”&gt;/req/ade/properties&lt;/xref&gt;</subject>
<component exclude="false" class="test-purpose" original-id="_695840be-f83b-43d3-8b74-2bb7c97e42b2"><p semx-id="_e777803c-f04b-f47b-dcd5-fb49d47ae2d5" original-id="_e777803c-f04b-f47b-dcd5-fb49d47ae2d5">To validate that Application Domain Extensions (ADE) to the CityGML Conceptual Model implement extension properties correctly.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="test method type" original-id="_86c98e10-9a6d-451a-ad47-f914b8574f2b"><p semx-id="_0ddd45fc-10e3-f4c6-0c7e-ddcfa73ee795" original-id="_0ddd45fc-10e3-f4c6-0c7e-ddcfa73ee795">Manual Inspection</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="test method" original-id="_43a062fe-ddf2-40c5-a447-80530aa01a95"><component exclude="false" class="step" id="_1f7a1891-e9a6-4807-be57-1ad96f6f063a"><p semx-id="_2d2bce04-b390-77de-84c1-630451fba6fe" id="_2d2bce04-b390-77de-84c1-630451fba6fe">Every Feature Type in the CityGML Conceptual Model includes an extension property whos’ purpose is to allow an ADE to add properties to that existing Feature Type. In every case where an extension property has been used:</p>

<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_24e90776-f69e-4a6d-bea2-78d8b0d67ced"><p semx-id="_744975de-4888-f721-5e98-f10631897992" id="_744975de-4888-f721-5e98-f10631897992">Validate that the ADE creates a subclass of the abstract data type associated with the extension property.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_a1de4e33-4057-4aac-8361-005c4b398d2d"><p semx-id="_28de48a7-c555-a91e-fe2e-91207d2baf27" id="_28de48a7-c555-a91e-fe2e-91207d2baf27">Validate that this subclass is defined as a data type using the stereotype <em>«DataType»</em>.</p>
</component>
<component exclude="false" class="step" id="_0dc08ba7-54dd-4ecc-9ffd-c01db033f1dc"><p semx-id="_0320f679-355c-157b-a793-9f5f85deda46" id="_0320f679-355c-157b-a793-9f5f85deda46">Validate that all application-specific attributes and associations for that Feature Type are modeled as properties of the ADE subclass.</p>
</component></component></component><fmt-provision id="_4f3c7612-150b-92eb-e945-6f8fbaeeced0"><table id="ats_ade_properties" type="recommendtest" class="modspec"><thead><tr><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2"><p class="RecommendationTestTitle"><fmt-name id="_a682a480-35a0-cd2f-a891-7af1d1e69671"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Abstract test</span> A<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>50</span></fmt-name></p></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><th>Subject</th><td><semx element="subject" source="_34c74876-981b-4501-8b83-6127a8880371">&lt;xref target=”req_ade_properties” type=”inline”&gt;/req/ade/properties&lt;/xref&gt;</semx></td></tr><tr id="_695840be-f83b-43d3-8b74-2bb7c97e42b2"><th>Test purpose</th><td><semx element="component" source="_695840be-f83b-43d3-8b74-2bb7c97e42b2"><p id="_e777803c-f04b-f47b-dcd5-fb49d47ae2d5" semx-id="_e777803c-f04b-f47b-dcd5-fb49d47ae2d5">To validate that Application Domain Extensions (ADE) to the CityGML Conceptual Model implement extension properties correctly.</p>
</semx></td></tr><tr id="_86c98e10-9a6d-451a-ad47-f914b8574f2b"><th>Test method type</th><td><semx element="component" source="_86c98e10-9a6d-451a-ad47-f914b8574f2b"><p id="_0ddd45fc-10e3-f4c6-0c7e-ddcfa73ee795" semx-id="_0ddd45fc-10e3-f4c6-0c7e-ddcfa73ee795">Manual Inspection</p>
</semx></td></tr><tr id="_43a062fe-ddf2-40c5-a447-80530aa01a95"><th>Test method</th><td><semx element="component" source="_43a062fe-ddf2-40c5-a447-80530aa01a95"><ol class="steps"><li><semx element="component" source="_1f7a1891-e9a6-4807-be57-1ad96f6f063a"><p semx-id="_2d2bce04-b390-77de-84c1-630451fba6fe" original-id="_2d2bce04-b390-77de-84c1-630451fba6fe">Every Feature Type in the CityGML Conceptual Model includes an extension property whos’ purpose is to allow an ADE to add properties to that existing Feature Type. In every case where an extension property has been used:</p>

<ol class="steps"><li><semx element="component" source="_24e90776-f69e-4a6d-bea2-78d8b0d67ced"><p semx-id="_744975de-4888-f721-5e98-f10631897992" original-id="_744975de-4888-f721-5e98-f10631897992">Validate that the ADE creates a subclass of the abstract data type associated with the extension property.</p>
</semx></li><li><semx element="component" source="_a1de4e33-4057-4aac-8361-005c4b398d2d"><p semx-id="_28de48a7-c555-a91e-fe2e-91207d2baf27" original-id="_28de48a7-c555-a91e-fe2e-91207d2baf27">Validate that this subclass is defined as a data type using the stereotype <em>«DataType»</em>.</p>
</semx></li><li><semx element="component" source="_0dc08ba7-54dd-4ecc-9ffd-c01db033f1dc"><p semx-id="_0320f679-355c-157b-a793-9f5f85deda46" original-id="_0320f679-355c-157b-a793-9f5f85deda46">Validate that all application-specific attributes and associations for that Feature Type are modeled as properties of the ADE subclass.</p>
</semx></li></ol>

</semx></li></ol></semx></td></tr></tbody></table></fmt-provision></requirement>
</clause>
