<definition id="_6e38bf26-e780-9ac1-22ea-5112317d40f0" semx-id="_6e38bf26-e780-9ac1-22ea-5112317d40f0"><verbal-definition semx-id="_08ef1e90-b643-bb16-c409-d3ddbcf6d98d" id="_08ef1e90-b643-bb16-c409-d3ddbcf6d98d"><p semx-id="_6565af0c-271a-634a-2cdb-1822c8c0289b" original-id="_6565af0c-271a-634a-2cdb-1822c8c0289b">ScopedName is a composite of a LocalName for locating another NameSpace and a GenericName valid in that NameSpace. ScopedName contains a LocalName as head and a GenericName, which might be a LocalName or a ScopedName, as tail.</p></verbal-definition></definition><fmt-definition id="_9642fd05-5b23-759a-6e8d-e2e9b77fd635"><semx element="definition" source="_6e38bf26-e780-9ac1-22ea-5112317d40f0"><p id="_6565af0c-271a-634a-2cdb-1822c8c0289b" semx-id="_6565af0c-271a-634a-2cdb-1822c8c0289b">ScopedName is a composite of a LocalName for locating another NameSpace and a GenericName valid in that NameSpace. ScopedName contains a LocalName as head and a GenericName, which might be a LocalName or a ScopedName, as tail.</p></semx></fmt-definition>


