</bibitem><bibitem id="Groger2012b" type="standard" schema-version="v1.5.6" anchor="Groger2012b" semx-id="_0b9a3e7b-49bc-dfe5-1eb9-efbf956e752a"><biblio-tag>[4]<tab/></biblio-tag><formattedref>Gerhard Gröger, Thomas H. Kolbe, Claus Nagel, Karl-Heinz Häfele, Open Geospatial Consortium: OGC 12-019, <em>OGC City Geography Markup Language (CityGML) Encoding Standard</em>. Open Geospatial Consortium (2012). <fmt-link target="http://www.opengis.net/spec/citygml/2.0">http://www.opengis.net/spec/citygml/2.0</fmt-link>.</formattedref>
